// The fuzzer's bugs (design/lexdb-fuzz.md, "Bugs found (main 757c4cee)"), each statement against PostgreSQL 18's
// answer, with SET lexdb_batch = off and on (a write in a transaction rolled back each time).
// - W1: a JOIN binds tighter than a comma: FROM a, b RIGHT JOIN c is a x (b RIGHT JOIN c), not (a x b) RIGHT JOIN c.
//   RIGHT, FULL, LEFT and inner joins after a comma; an empty table on each side; a view, a derived table, a CTE; a tree
//   inside LATERAL and inside a subquery; three items in a tree, two trees, a tree followed by items, a LATERAL after it
//   that reads it and one in it that reads an item before it; USING and NATURAL in the tree (* and the merged name);
//   WHERE and GROUP BY over it; a name twice (42712); UPDATE ... FROM and DELETE ... USING with a tree.
// - W2: char(n) beside varchar and text in subqueries, over a table and a view: IN, NOT IN, EXISTS, a scalar, > ANY,
//   <= ALL and a join, each pair both ways; ANY over arrays; empty subqueries, duplicates, NULLs.
// - E1: a correlated LATERAL (or derived table) inside a correlated EXISTS, IN or scalar subquery that reads the outer
//   query's column: the subquery is not run once and hashed (08P01 there is no parameter $1 before).
// - E2: round(numeric, int) with a NULL value or scale: NULL (42883 before, on the rows that had one).
// - E3: an index range's bound past the column's type (numeric(6,2), smallint, int, bigint), constant or per row: no
//   rows or no bound (22003 before).
// The second pass (unnest off: lexdb_plan.setUnnest(0)) runs the subqueries' statements again, each as written.
// expect: W1 doc, t1 empty, right join: , same: true
// expect: W1 doc, full join on false: 8, same: true
// expect: W1 right join: 1|10|1|1|1|5;1|10|NULL|NULL|4|6;1|10|NULL|NULL|NULL|8;2|20|1|1|1|5;2|20|1|1|1|5;2|20|NULL|NULL|4|6;2|20|NULL|NULL|4|6;2|20|NULL|NULL|NULL|8;2|20|NULL|NULL|NULL|8, same: true
// expect: W1 full join: 1|10|1|1|1|5;1|10|3|3|NULL|NULL;1|10|NULL|7|NULL|NULL;1|10|NULL|NULL|4|6;1|10|NULL|NULL|NULL|8;2|20|1|1|1|5;2|20|1|1|1|5;2|20|3|3|NULL|NULL;2|20|3|3|NULL|NULL;2|20|NULL|7|NULL|NULL;2|20|NULL|7|NULL|NULL;2|20|NULL|NULL|4|6;2|20|NULL|NULL|4|6;2|20|NULL|NULL|NULL|8;2|20|NULL|NULL|NULL|8, same: true
// expect: W1 left join: 1|10|1|1|1|5;1|10|3|3|NULL|NULL;1|10|NULL|7|NULL|NULL;2|20|1|1|1|5;2|20|1|1|1|5;2|20|3|3|NULL|NULL;2|20|3|3|NULL|NULL;2|20|NULL|7|NULL|NULL;2|20|NULL|7|NULL|NULL, same: true
// expect: W1 inner join: 1|10|1|1|1|5;2|20|1|1|1|5;2|20|1|1|1|5, same: true
// expect: W1 empty first: 0, same: true
// expect: W1 empty right: 0, same: true
// expect: W1 empty left of full: 9|0|6, same: true
